 "Fair <em>questions</em>": "<em>你可能想问</em>",
 "You are being asked to install something from a stranger on the internet. These are the answers.": "你正被要求安装一个网上陌生人做的应用。下面是我们的回答。",
 "Is it safe?": "安全吗？",
 "Every line of it is public. You can read the source, build it yourself, and check the file you downloaded against the one the build produces. That is more than you can do with almost anything on the Play Store.": "每一行代码都是公开的。你可以阅读源代码、自己编译，并核对你下载的文件与编译出的文件是否一致。Play 商店里几乎没有哪个应用能让你做到这一点。",
 "It asks for no permissions it does not use, contains no advertising or analytics library of any kind, and sends nothing anywhere except to the services you switch on yourself.": "它不申请任何用不到的权限，不含任何广告或统计分析库，除了你自己开启的服务之外，不会向任何地方发送数据。",
 "Every release lists the fingerprint of the key it is signed with and a checksum for each file, so you can check that what you installed came from here.": "每个版本都会列出签名密钥的指纹和每个文件的校验和，你可以确认装上的应用确实来自这里。",
 "Why isn't it on the Play Store?": "为什么 Play 商店里没有？",
 "Apps that stream audio from YouTube are removed from it. That is why none of the players in this category are there. It is a rule about distribution, not a judgement about the app.": "从 YouTube 播放音频的应用会被 Play 商店下架，所以这类播放器一个都不在上面。这是关于分发渠道的规定，而不是对应用本身的评判。",
 "Why does Android warn me?": "为什么 Android 会弹出警告？",
 "Android shows that warning for any app not installed from a store, whoever wrote it. It is telling you that nobody has vetted the file. That is true, and it is exactly why the source being public matters.": "凡是不从应用商店安装的应用，无论是谁开发的，Android 都会显示这个警告。它是在告诉你：没有人审核过这个文件。这是事实，也正因如此，源代码公开才格外重要。",
 "Does it need root?": "需要 root 吗？",
 "No. It is an ordinary app and runs on any phone with Android 8.0 or newer.": "不需要。它就是一个普通应用，可在任何 Android 8.0 及以上的手机上运行。",
 "How do I get updates?": "怎么获取更新？",
 "Blazify checks for them itself and offers to download and install a new version when there is one. To try new versions before everyone else, switch on Get beta updates in Settings › Updater.": "Blazify 会自动检查更新，有新版本时会提示你下载并安装。想抢先体验新版本，可在 设置 › 更新器 中开启“获取测试版更新”。",
 "If you would rather one app managed everything you sideload, <a href=\"https://github.com/ImranR98/Obtainium\">Obtainium</a> watches this project and updates it for you.": "如果你希望用一个应用统一管理所有侧载应用，<a href=\"https://github.com/ImranR98/Obtainium\">Obtainium</a> 可以关注这个项目并替你更新。",
 "Do I have to sign in?": "必须登录吗？",
 "No. Search, playback, downloads, lyrics and the equalizer all work without an account.": "不必。搜索、播放、下载、歌词和均衡器都无需账号即可使用。",
 "Signing in with Google adds your own YouTube Music library, your playlists and history, and recommendations based on what you actually play. It is entirely optional and you can sign out at any time.": "使用 Google 账号登录后，你可以使用自己的 YouTube Music 音乐库、歌单和播放记录，并获得基于你实际收听内容的推荐。登录完全可选，随时都能退出。",
 "Will it drain my battery?": "会很耗电吗？",
 "No more than any music player. It streams audio only, never video, so it uses less data and less battery than watching the same song on YouTube.": "不会比其他音乐播放器更耗电。它只播放音频，从不加载视频，所以比在 YouTube 上看同一首歌更省流量、更省电。",
 "What does it cost?": "要花钱吗？",
 "Nothing, and there is nothing to buy inside it. No advertisements, no subscription, no paid tier. It is free software under the GPL-3.0 licence.": "一分钱都不用，应用内也没有任何付费项目。没有广告，没有订阅，没有付费版。它是采用 GPL-3.0 许可证的自由软件。",
 "Everything, <em>nothing extra</em>": "应有尽有，<em>别无冗余</em>",
 "The things a music player should do, done properly. Works signed out; signs in when you want it to.": "音乐播放器该做的事，都做到位。不登录也能用；想登录时随时可以。",
