 "<span class=\"n\">Android Auto only</span>": "<span class=\"n\">仅 Android Auto</span>",
 "Also on desktop and iPhone": "同时支持桌面和 iPhone",
 "Why <em>another one</em>": "为什么<em>又来一个</em>",
 "There are a dozen open-source music players. Here is what is actually different about this one, including the part that is not flattering.": "开源音乐播放器已经有十几个了。下面说说这一个到底有什么不同，包括不那么光彩的部分。",
 "Almost every open-source music player that streams from YouTube is built on the same foundation, and inherits the same worst failure along with it: <b>songs that stop partway through, or refuse to start at all</b>, whenever YouTube changes something at their end. If you have tried one of these apps and quietly given up on it, that is almost certainly what happened.": "几乎所有从 YouTube 播放的开源音乐播放器都建立在同一个基础上，也随之继承了同一个最糟糕的问题：每当 YouTube 那边有所改动，<b>歌曲就会播到一半停下，甚至根本无法开始</b>。如果你用过这类应用，后来又默默放弃了，那几乎可以肯定就是这个原因。",
 "Most of the work here has gone into that. The player was asking for audio streams it had no way to decode, which guaranteed a refusal on a step that reported no error at all. Two of the three fallback paths had been quietly returning nothing for every song, because the component they depend on was never handed anything to fetch with. Both are fixed. It is an arms race rather than a bug, so what matters is not that it works today but how quickly it gets repaired when it next breaks.": "这里的大部分心血都花在了这件事上。播放器一直在请求它根本无法解码的音频流，注定会在一个不报任何错误的环节被拒绝。三条备用路径中有两条对每首歌都在悄无声息地返回空结果，因为它们所依赖的组件从来没有拿到任何可用于获取数据的东西。这两个问题都已修复。这更像一场军备竞赛，而不是一个 bug，所以重要的不是今天能用，而是下次出问题时能多快修好。",
 "The other difference is reach. <b>Nearly all of them run on one platform.</b> Blazify is one project across Android, Windows, Linux and iPhone, written by one person in Kathmandu, where a dropped connection is ordinary and mobile data is not cheap. That is why the music already on your phone plays beside everything streamed, and why offline was never an afterthought.": "另一个不同在于覆盖面。<b>它们几乎都只能在一个平台上运行。</b>Blazify 是一个横跨 Android、Windows、Linux 和 iPhone 的项目，由加德满都的一个人独立开发；在那里，断网是家常便饭，移动流量也不便宜。所以手机里已有的音乐能和在线内容一起播放，离线功能也从来不是事后才想到的。",
 "It is <a href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.en.html\" rel=\"noopener\">GPL-3.0</a>, so you can read every line of it. Playback is <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/media/media3\" rel=\"noopener\">Media3</a>, lyrics come from <a href=\"https://lrclib.net\" rel=\"noopener\">LrcLib</a> among others, and it is submitted to <a href=\"https://f-droid.org\" rel=\"noopener\">F-Droid</a>, whose build servers compile it from source and check the result matches the file published here.": "它采用 <a href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.en.html\" rel=\"noopener\">GPL-3.0</a> 许可证，每一行代码你都能读到。播放由 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/media/media3\" rel=\"noopener\">Media3</a> 驱动，歌词来自 <a href=\"https://lrclib.net\" rel=\"noopener\">LrcLib</a> 等来源。它已提交至 <a href=\"https://f-droid.org\" rel=\"noopener\">F-Droid</a>，F-Droid 的构建服务器会从源代码编译，并核对结果与这里发布的文件是否一致。",
 "What's <em>coming next</em>": "<em>即将推出</em>",
 "Blazify is built in the open, and the people using it decide what comes next. Every idea below has its own post. Upvote the ones you want, and the most wanted get built first.": "Blazify 公开开发，接下来做什么由用户决定。下面每个想法都有自己的帖子。给你想要的点赞，呼声最高的会最先实现。",
 "<span class=\"rm-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Just released<small>9.16.0</small>": "<span class=\"rm-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>刚刚发布<small>9.16.0</small>",
 "Out now. Update from Settings › Updater, or download it above.": "现已推出。可在 设置 › 更新器 中更新，或在上方下载。",
 "<span><b>Video Art player</b><small>The song's own video behind the player, in step and muted</small></span>": "<span><b>视频封面播放器</b><small>歌曲自己的视频在播放器背后同步静音播放</small></span>",
 "<span><b>Import from Spotify</b><small>Paste a share link and the playlist is rebuilt</small></span>": "<span><b>从 Spotify 导入</b><small>粘贴分享链接，即可重建歌单</small></span>",
 "<span><b>Skip the talking</b><small>SponsorBlock, with the lyrics shifted to match</small></span>": "<span><b>跳过说话部分</b><small>支持 SponsorBlock，歌词也会随之对齐</small></span>",
 "<span><b>Radio stations play</b><small>Live broadcasts, marked LIVE while on air</small></span>": "<span><b>电台直播</b><small>直播节目，播出时标记 LIVE</small></span>",
 "<span><b>Block an artist</b><small>Out of Home, search, picks and radio</small></span>": "<span><b>屏蔽艺人</b><small>不再出现在首页、搜索、推荐和电台中</small></span>",
 "<span><b>Swipe to play next</b><small>One flick moves a song up the queue</small></span>": "<span><b>滑动设为下一首</b><small>轻轻一滑，歌曲就排到队列前面</small></span>",
 "<span><b>Share a playlist</b><small>As a link or a QR code</small></span>": "<span><b>分享歌单</b><small>以链接或二维码的形式</small></span>",
 "<span><b>Sideways, properly</b><small>Every player design laid out for a phone on its side</small></span>": "<span><b>横屏完美适配</b><small>每种播放器设计都为横屏手机重新排版</small></span>",
 "<span><b>15 more languages</b><small>Spanish, Portuguese, Hindi, Arabic, Chinese and more</small></span>": "<span><b>新增 15 种语言</b><small>西班牙语、葡萄牙语、印地语、阿拉伯语、中文等</small></span>",
 "<span class=\"rm-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Planned<small>3 ideas</small>": "<span class=\"rm-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>已计划<small>3 个想法</small>",
 "Decided, and waiting their turn. Votes set the order.": "已经确定，排队等候中。投票决定先后顺序。",
 "<span class=\"rm-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Considering<small>3 ideas</small>": "<span class=\"rm-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>考虑中<small>3 个想法</small>",
 "Not decided yet. Enough votes move an idea up to Planned.": "尚未确定。票数足够的想法会升级为“已计划”。",
 "<a href=\"https://github.com/rajendra7169/blazify/discussions/17\" rel=\"noopener\">Pick what's built first</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/rajendra7169/blazify/issues/new?template=feature_request.yml\" rel=\"noopener\">Suggest a feature</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/rajendra7169/blazify/blob/main/ROADMAP.md\" rel=\"noopener\">Full roadmap</a>": "<a href=\"https://github.com/rajendra7169/blazify/discussions/17\" rel=\"noopener\">投票决定先做什么</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/rajendra7169/blazify/issues/new?template=feature_request.yml\" rel=\"noopener\">提出功能建议</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/rajendra7169/blazify/blob/main/ROADMAP.md\" rel=\"noopener\">完整路线图</a>",
 "NO ADS. NO TRACKING.": "无广告。无跟踪。",
 "Blazify has no advertising, no analytics and no tracking libraries of any kind. Nothing is sent anywhere except to the services you turn on yourself. Signing in is optional. Almost everything works without an account.": "Blazify 不含任何广告、统计分析或跟踪库。除了你自己开启的服务之外，不会向任何地方发送数据。登录完全可选，几乎所有功能都无需账号即可使用。",
 "Rajendra Pandey": "Rajendra Pandey",
 "Developer · Kathmandu, Nepal": "开发者 · 尼泊尔加德满都",
 "I built Blazify because every music app I tried wanted my money, my attention, or my data. Usually all three. This one asks for none of it. It is written in the open, it will stay free, and every release is tested on my own phone before anyone else gets it.": "我做 Blazify，是因为我试过的每个音乐应用都想要我的钱、我的注意力或我的数据，通常三样全要。而这个应用一样都不要。它公开开发，会一直免费，每个版本在交给大家之前，都会先在我自己的手机上测试。",
 "<a href=\"https://github.com/rajendra7169\">GitHub</a> <a href=\"https://www.rajendrapandey.info.np/\">Website</a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/raja.indra7169\">Instagram</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/rajendra7169/blazify/blob/main/ROADMAP.md\">Roadmap</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/rajendra7169/blazify/issues\">Report a bug</a>": "<a href=\"https://github.com/rajendra7169\">GitHub</a> <a href=\"https://www.rajendrapandey.info.np/\">网站</a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/raja.indra7169\">Instagram</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/rajendra7169/blazify/blob/main/ROADMAP.md\">路线图</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/rajendra7169/blazify/issues\">报告 Bug</a>",
 "Help Blazify <em>grow</em>": "帮助 Blazify <em>成长</em>",
 "Enjoying Blazify? It's made by one person and spreads by word of mouth, so each of these makes a real difference. Most take less than a minute.": "喜欢 Blazify 吗？它由一个人开发，靠口碑传播，所以下面每一件事都能带来实实在在的帮助。大多数只需不到一分钟。",
 "Star us on GitHub<span class=\"hg-count\" id=\"helpStars\" hidden></span>": "在 GitHub 上给我们点 Star<span class=\"hg-count\" id=\"helpStars\" hidden></span>",
 "One tap. Stars are how new people decide an open-source app is worth trying.": "点一下就好。新用户正是看 Star 数来判断一个开源应用值不值得一试。",
 "Report bugs": "报告 Bug",
 "Something broken? The form takes a minute, and only one box is required.": "有东西坏了？填表只需一分钟，而且只有一项必填。",
 "Suggest features": "建议功能",
 "Tell us what's missing, or upvote an idea that's already on the roadmap.": "告诉我们还缺什么，或者给路线图上已有的想法点赞。",
 "Share Blazify": "分享 Blazify",
 "Send it to a friend who's tired of ads. Most people find Blazify this way.": "把它发给受够了广告的朋友。大多数人都是这样发现 Blazify 的。",
 "Contribute": "参与贡献",
 "Fix a bug, polish a screen or help test new builds. Pull requests and UI/UX ideas are both welcome.": "修复 Bug、打磨界面，或帮忙测试新版本。欢迎提交 Pull Request，也欢迎 UI/UX 建议。",
 "Join our community": "加入社区",
 "Follow the WhatsApp channel for news, and ask anything in Discussions.": "关注 WhatsApp 频道获取最新消息，有任何问题都可以在 Discussions 中提问。",
